{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "ca6cd22378d5d391dc12da0073f17427380eb8d8cf94596245358f4c54c6302d", "ja": "ボーイ・ミーツ・ガール", "zh": "Boy Meets Girl", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "edf8703b64705ab3e801abe0d93543e5dd68fb07fd94537905cbeea5842bae07", "ja": "演劇『昏き星、遠い月』の稽古が始まる。\n恵美と朋花は人間の少年とヴァンパイアの\n少女の出会い、千鶴と莉緒はヴァンパイア\nハンターの苦悩と、思惑を見事に演じる。\n稽古は初回から順調な様子を見せる。", "zh": "舞台剧『昏暗之星，遥远之月』开始排练了。\n惠美和朋花饰演了人类少年\n与吸血鬼少女的邂逅过程，\n千鹤和莉绪诠释出吸血鬼猎人的苦恼与意图，\n各个演技精湛。排练从一开始就相当顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "38291b14e873d14512085e7f0eb32f522c76377a02cf12b7446b8afc9cacb12b", "ja": "みんな、集まったな。今日からいよいよ、\n『昏き星、遠い月』の立ち稽古開始だ。", "zh": "大家都到了吧？\n今天要开始进行『昏暗之星，遥远之月』的走位排练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "5b99fb4d4e28f2b744647aae9228e8baaa860e9d57c76852a11f406c05d46293", "ja": "台本の読み合わせはしてきましたが、\nこうして立ち稽古になると、気分が変わりますね～。", "zh": "虽然我们已经对过台词了，\n不过走位排练又是另一种感觉呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "8410a07975b9e3de61d9d434292d07c8e8106fef004e6d038e9f3406f5192cdb", "ja": "ホントだよね！　\nさ、始めよっか、みんな！", "zh": "真的！\n来，我们赶快开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "152ff0a3e6e354d073939d0f11dd98f44cfa896252b98b2f64b7f46b5c260781", "ja": "はあっ、はあっ、はあっ……。\n路地裏の、あの死体……。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……\n巷子里的那具尸体……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "dce936dc299f80c11cf68295ac8b166fa7ae611bfe0eb916029b9d26febf0d35", "ja": "間違いない、あれはヴァンパイアの仕業だ。\nまだ、この辺りにいるかもしれない……！", "zh": "绝对没错，那是吸血鬼的杰作。\n吸血鬼可能还在这附近……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "c71dabb7be8035011d852c1d01ad5bc7c80735cf552680af49fdefee643cc2d4", "ja": "早く、遠くまで逃げないと……！\nあっ、あそこに誰かいる？", "zh": "必须赶快逃走，远离这里……！\n啊，那里好像有人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "b260efbc3c6160c309f9c64901298d64008f7fb09f8e56eb639227da83ee3088", "ja": "おい、そこのアンタ！", "zh": "喂，那边那位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "bb501a03e7993a2d2bc9640abe0b0c42bcf02a6d646f0cb146d27b42777bca36", "ja": "……？\n私……ですか……？", "zh": "……？\n请问是在……叫我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "4bd61efbdafa287a0b3f77d120b162f838af68868d049f3a85a58a758ed3e113", "ja": "あ……アンタみたいなお嬢さんが、こんな危ないトコで\n何してるんだ？　ウロウロしてると危ないぞ。", "zh": "啊……像你这样的小姐在这种危险的地方做什么？\n你这样四处乱晃很危险的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "b727800fa52f80c234eec3530712b7ba101f412d2768a30ee0bc554ad7a04c34", "ja": "うふふ……貴方、優しいんですね～？", "zh": "呵呵……你真是体贴～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "3c0e572ebd36323a657600b8a8aac4c1fcf4c347e51a1f04d7a7f5659cc568ac", "ja": "ハァ？　何言ってんだか……。", "zh": "啊？你在说什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1012_se", "source_sha256": "1c49d46398286da48800ba373f06000119ac7f3a99e220b2e4c6bf6e71bf1366", "ja": "ガサッ", "zh": "（沙沙）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "b9ff303cc9a1296d20786f9f8e18c5e1dc0a95a47021c03eab1e6ea58e483651", "ja": "……！　しまった、来たか！？\nオイ、アンタ！　逃げるぞ！", "zh": "……！糟糕，过来这里了吗！？\n喂，小姐！赶快逃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "7836abc799aa9c5f4d8dd24739af532448200da8fb8793832372a26442abe388", "ja": "逃げる……私が？\n……何故？", "zh": "快逃……我吗？\n……为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "f70ab526c4f41c57cec0e52d7df560b34272714acc0e9afd4aa5d51826c8cd12", "ja": "他に誰がいるんだよ！？\n説明は後だ、行くぞ！", "zh": "除了你还有谁啊！？\n待会再跟你说明，赶快走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "fde8cd63f58bc4ade8df766fc02c90dcce185822e49a2128a0a697858171f293", "ja": "はあ、はあ……。ここまで来りゃ多分大丈夫だろ……。\nいきなり手を引っ張っちまって、悪かったな。", "zh": "呼、呼……逃到这里来应该没问题了……\n突然拉着你的手，真抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "654348e7247a84a62ce231bf61bb18e3499c000b3131cecdba8a4600efe1788f", "ja": "いえ……危ないところを、助けていただいた……\nのでしょうか？　ありがとうございます……。", "zh": "没事……你是在千钧一发之际救了我……吗？\n谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "db1fc7efa364dd3a7ff593411c6d7c6e6a7751a74d01da363f44bfb31775113c", "ja": "……って言うか、なんであんなとこにいたんだ、\nアンタ？　見たとこ、どっかのお嬢様だろ。", "zh": "……话说回来，你为什么会在那种地方？\n看你的样子，应该是某户人家的大小姐吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "ce855080c4bc5416b22b4cee0d310bb0e55d31793a64bf5b3bc3cdd2733cf7d4", "ja": "ええ、用事があったんです。\n……もう、その用は済みましたが……。", "zh": "嗯，我是去那里办点事情。\n……不过事情已经办完了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "a4632590544a79c586afbf3f72b21d3558f336ff9285721bbcfbf1931620903d", "ja": "あんな治安の悪いところに、用事だって……？", "zh": "去治安那么差的地方办事情……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "547a3d348502aad9e2b1917f6ce2f390ca4f58c04fd581e9fff9d7bcab4e457c", "ja": "ふふ……。ごきげんよう、優しい紳士さん。\n機会があれば、また……。", "zh": "呵呵……请多保重，温柔体贴的绅士先生。\n有机会再见面了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "791e9bad6150b4be6f27f790848d885314909532d1336edfedc1aabf5e6ea4d5", "ja": "……ねぇ、{$P$}！\nエドガーとクリスが出会うシーン、どうだった？", "zh": "……{$P$}，问你喔！\n这段艾德嘉跟克利丝相遇的场景，演得如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5f4948c5744f4c031f4dc6b03586a3b42fe9cb8301cbf12e74a1f53cdfe9b116", "ja": "うん、恵美も朋花も良かったと思う。\n出だしは順調だな。", "zh": "嗯，惠美跟朋花都演得很好。\n一开始就很顺利呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "34bdcb69b7a8331982f1267b2b32773d265794921e2d9c575351f91bef5ca385", "ja": "ふふっ。私達なら、当然のことですね～♪\nこの調子で行きましょう～。", "zh": "呵呵，我们演得好是理所当然的～♪\n就照这样保持下去吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "9ce1b95d5b8ada78956b4741c405e68a055c697fea90e2dbc6578fa7f79a1c29", "ja": "うん！　……このシーンの次の日も、クリスは、\nエドガーの住む治安の悪い街に来るんだよね。", "zh": "嗯！……这段场景的隔天，\n克利丝会到艾德嘉住的这个治安很差的镇上来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "61ee56e7bfbe6c63d1d3e99858381b9ca75328f87318bb31071164b1de60d0fe", "ja": "はい。そして、再び出会うエドガーとクリス……。\nふたりは徐々に惹かれあっていくんですよ～♪", "zh": "没错，然后再次相遇的艾德嘉和克利丝……\n两人会渐渐受到对方吸引～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "39e969dd94ff7db29d8803d2f9ca774428ba40e5fbf32d48300b9997c773146d", "ja": "次は、そのシーンからだ。\nふたりとも、準備してくれ。", "zh": "接下来就是从那一段开始。\n你们两个准备一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "251dafcfddfa42899bc995a3bb09869263947279d91bacca00b22cfbbfd9e55f", "ja": "（少しずつお互いを知り、惹かれあっていくエドガーと\nクリス。だがある日、エドガーが倒れてしまう……）", "zh": "（艾德嘉和克利丝逐渐了解对方，两人的心越来越靠近。\n但是有一天，艾德嘉晕倒了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "84bd0a42e03450e5889201b7997dd0f33eceb4fb1f9a18a278a341c777f951a4", "ja": "……ううっ。\n！？　ここは……？", "zh": "……唔唔。\n咦！？这里是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "86798271d350d4198a9ce26307e3881a37972cf4d2333813fb1699abfd8ca693", "ja": "私の家です。貴方、突然倒れたんですよ。道端に、\n放っておくわけにはいきませんでしたから……。", "zh": "是我家。\n你突然晕倒了，我不能就这样把你丢在路边不管……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "6c33ab24e1f16698688a94002d51a4f7a7499645247bcdc6fff9ad4189c59045", "ja": "疲れが溜まっていたんですね。服が煤で\n汚れていたので、着替えさせてもらいました……。", "zh": "你应该是太累了。\n然后你的衣服被煤炭弄脏，我帮你换掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "92a3dcc44287acaf5406fba8c57c73549e6aab4e82dcfa9603dd5573f3f2aca6", "ja": "！？　……お、オレの体、見たのか……。", "zh": "！？\n……你、你看到我的身体了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1033_031tom", "source_sha256": "0274ea71dc3ebcaa41ac5592c721349222d20a8e597492e611d059248f8aef50", "ja": "……ええ。", "zh": "……是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "a5de3347a034379015dd260f678b627c704868afcc2414cb796fb1ccd5a5fd6f", "ja": "そっか。……ゴメン。", "zh": "这样啊……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "8b088f30014bc1bea8bb117ce564136374a9f485b8422b7103ea77a5d9fa6701", "ja": "どうして謝るんですか……？", "zh": "你为什么要道歉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1036_020meg", "source_sha256": "38938dc32750a192d6f93c19a58a3a726d1f4b00abc755b0eef36058d6154da7", "ja": "だって、ウソをついてただろ。本当はオレ、\n女なのに……ずっと、男のフリをしてたから……。", "zh": "因为我说了谎。\n其实我是女的……却一直假装自己是男的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "d895dd746991b42030d74ebfd907b879f0056139c40f3a383ceb31823a0f769a", "ja": "母さんが死んでから、ずっと男として生きてきた。\nあんな場所じゃ、女は生きていけないから……。", "zh": "自从我妈妈过世之后，我就一直用男性的身分生活。\n因为在那种地方，女性是生存不下去的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "f46d852ed9500fd594cd70eb5576bbe489298d1ccac9ce012aab3de808251a6d", "ja": "……騙してゴメン、クリス。", "zh": "……抱歉我骗了你，克利丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1039_031tom", "source_sha256": "cd86a3b9e63f78ea20d2f8f5b9044be1077c2ed3a10451b8ebf6028191c99e44", "ja": "いいえ。ウソなら、私もついていますから……。", "zh": "别这样说，因为我也说了谎……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1040_020meg", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1041_031tom", "source_sha256": "bb2ff619b96926562aba77c354d583e6d365db01fd429d2c5818bd0248accefe", "ja": "私は……本当は、男なんです……。", "zh": "其实……我是男的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "7c9202d4ed948bd09955a83012e4ed8ef7a72e007fd79cb6aa3cee77c55cf115", "ja": "ここで、第一幕の朋花と恵美の出番は終わりだな。\nふたりとも、お疲れさま！", "zh": "第一幕朋花和惠美出场的部分就到这边。\n你们两位，辛苦啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1043_031tom", "source_sha256": "c794eda7330ad209f11f71658a3ba13ca61ae203cc7ff45d1436840c14c5489f", "ja": "エドガーが実は女の子で、クリスが実は男の子……。\n少し変わった形のボーイ・ミーツ・ガールですね～。", "zh": "艾德嘉其实是女孩子，克利丝其实是男孩子……\n是形式稍微不同的Boy meets girl剧情呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "8a6378639f9ed6e9a867fdd2cb7abec43f58367ef053018e5f2757a3e1d5a6f8", "ja": "うんうん！　この後の展開が気になるな～……って、\n台本読んでるから知ってるんだけどさ。にゃはは♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！我好在意后面他们会怎么发展～\n……虽然我已经看过剧本，知道后面的剧情了，呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1045_038chz", "source_sha256": "b45d2b6cfdfa4b1aba9c96904145794a461f1c83d4c9178434891d897cb57e1f", "ja": "ステキな演技を見せていただきましたわ。\n次はわたくし達の出番ですわね！", "zh": "刚才已经见识完你们精湛的演技了。\n接下来轮到本小姐我们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "0bf55b61654ffe8e7c87cf287f7765f9924ed4a1074269be868119d94813f75f", "ja": "ウフフ、私のセクシーな悪女っぷりに、悩殺されても\n知らないわよ、{$P$}くん♪", "zh": "呵呵，如果被我演的性感坏女人迷得神魂颠倒，\n我可不负责喔，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1047_007ior", "source_sha256": "29d98fca9e44f3426a0e2ea0d04e2080cf7b36616868a3b6441e881eaa7aa0c4", "ja": "私はアレクサンドラの愛らし～い妹、ノエル役ね。\nなんだか、寝てばっかりみたいだけど……。", "zh": "我演的是亚历山大的超～可爱妹妹，诺艾儿。\n虽然我好像一直在睡觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1048_007ior", "source_sha256": "927ce0328fb3d262b614afbccc3c58b7f974e797a367c7fa4d3d45273d91e73d", "ja": "ま、いいわ。最高にカワイイ寝姿で、観客の視線を\nクギヅケにしちゃうんだから！　にひひっ♪", "zh": "不过没关系，我会用最可爱的睡脸来紧抓住观众的目光！\n咿嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1049_046rio", "source_sha256": "b8b8534e4b5b23543f19493649d6345e4e2c26cc433f901565fafee2e4153f27", "ja": "聞いたかしら？　アレクサンドラ。また罪のない\n人々が、ヴァンパイアの毒牙にかかったわ……。", "zh": "你听说了吗？亚历山大。\n又有无辜的人丧命在吸血鬼的毒牙之下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1050_046rio", "source_sha256": "492f41b043be6dc4b6d72604a298e591c651327c0e18621655fa12537bc35b3e", "ja": "国王陛下は民を哀れんで、命を下したわ。\nわが夫の辺境伯に、ヴァンパイア討滅の勅令をね。", "zh": "国王陛下怜悯百姓，所以下了命令，\n要我的丈夫藩侯去消灭吸血鬼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1051_038chz", "source_sha256": "0af8d616fb84f29adabbeb97f4fd223702438642fd3d41e58af716eeb32df8ab", "ja": "……バカバカしい。飢えた民の怒りを、\n腐敗した王政から逸らすのが目的だろう。", "zh": "……真愚蠢。他的目的是为了让饥饿的人民，\n将愤怒的矛头转离腐败的王政吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1052_046rio", "source_sha256": "9cff9b4b716e7d430d3dd3fa67f221a649005a6bce15c635eb19e028db80bebf", "ja": "フフ、そうね。民の血をより多く啜っているのは、\nヴァンパイアではなく、私たち貴族の方ですもの……。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。毕竟吸取最多人民的鲜血的，\n不是吸血鬼，而是我们这些贵族……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1053_046rio", "source_sha256": "cb9613845e7b58d04b8500d42157170bc8f89decd1d059a75e72061370660d89", "ja": "もちろん、卿にも参加していただくわ。\n不浄な怪物どもを討ち滅ぼす英雄として。", "zh": "当然，你也必须加入，\n以消灭肮脏怪物的英雄的身分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1054_038chz", "source_sha256": "ab8569f7a85f24ad6ee9b78496060b34d72c214ab65c3a208febb48e3f0ebe78", "ja": "不浄な怪物だと……？　元は人間だ。無辜の民だ。\nわが剣は人々を守る剣。理由もなく殺す事などできぬ！", "zh": "肮脏的怪物……？他们原本都是人类，是无辜的人民。\n我的剑是保护众人的剑。岂能毫无理由就滥杀无辜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1055_046rio", "source_sha256": "cf4b21c07845ad130b95a54aa5486503349da3c2d55ebb89d24dc94c83257dd2", "ja": "まあ、なんてご立派な騎士道なんでしょう。\n……けれども、その気高さで誰を救えるのかしら？", "zh": "还真是崇高的骑士精神呢。\n……但是光凭那份高洁志向，又能救得了谁呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1056_046rio", "source_sha256": "3ba389a78b716db169adf961709bb4d83f102c91df07d99ebc1d548653b8784e", "ja": "貴女の妹君……ノエルも、人の血を吸う化け物よねぇ。\nあの子を匿ってあげているのは、誰だったかしら……？", "zh": "你的妹妹……诺艾儿，她也是吸人血的怪物吧。\n你还记得是谁帮忙藏匿那孩子的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1057_038chz", "source_sha256": "7eb7be8d16d4dabd50498d0243756892d20f77269c8d509df731922eddefaf17", "ja": "……くっ！", "zh": "……呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1058_046rio", "source_sha256": "bd12cd0072bf63cdb753ca8899228bce14ae8d85bb21560c54adcb38c93508cc", "ja": "フフ。怖がらないで、アレクサンドラ。\nあの子は死なないわ……その剣が私のために働く限り。", "zh": "呵呵，别担心，亚历山大。\n只要你的剑愿意为我所用……那孩子就不会死。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1059_038chz", "source_sha256": "ce14ca144d0653638e59665d350450fb5bff094c2a34676211faa80302487b6f", "ja": "我が妹、ノエルがヴァンパイアに成り果てた\nあの事件から、数年が経つ……。", "zh": "距离我妹妹诺艾儿变成吸血鬼的事件，\n至今已经过了好几年……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1060_038chz", "source_sha256": "08a36b77a622a2eb66e2e603bd1328c61e67a08d5eb72b22d019ad4beba6f668", "ja": "あれ以来、ノエルはエレオノーラの香で眠っている。\n香がなければ……我が妹は目覚め、人を襲うだろう。", "zh": "从那之后，诺艾儿就靠着艾蕾欧诺拉的香一直沉睡着。\n如果没有那个香……我妹妹就会醒来袭击人类吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1061_038chz", "source_sha256": "1bdd9df7a690fbfa79780b9aca34181eabe89e7769a5e2b4d786b193ba72c83e", "ja": "ノエルを人間に戻す方法を探し続けているが、\n未だに糸口すら見つからぬまま……。", "zh": "虽然我不断在寻找让诺艾儿变回人类的方法，\n但仍未找到任何线索……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1062_038chz", "source_sha256": "b11431c788856e4ed4f304e1276a56c7bd7c609d555a3477a6e2264428a15bab", "ja": "私は、どうすれば……。", "zh": "我究竟该如何是好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1063_007ior", "source_sha256": "3d41c44672dcbdc0674b081d302afbba713b1f686b2506c8d755de0de78e8d78", "ja": "……お姉さま。", "zh": "……姊姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1064_038chz", "source_sha256": "03428d210a5006b6ea9acd25b68dbfeeada7e49afc2a90f63a96706918e76734", "ja": "ノエル。私の愛しい妹よ。\n今は夢の中でまどろんでいておくれ。いつか必ず……。", "zh": "诺艾儿，我心爱的妹妹。\n你先在梦中沉眠吧。总有一天，我一定会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1065_007ior", "source_sha256": "66f0ff0cd7a767afd30c9e2e97a66079191d70d010e599a6478fb478e4ad5a01", "ja": "ええ……なんだか、とても眠いの……。\n……大好きな、お姉さま……。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得、非常想睡……\n……我最喜欢的、姊姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1066_007ior", "source_sha256": "3f77419e1239dc311c10516e13091c441e0ea1cf8aeb2ab6c7af3beec20b413e", "ja": "……すー……。", "zh": "……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1067_038chz", "source_sha256": "b72c50c091a94d723895dd3b6e209728a817cf968310eb6ea4d441a1b97a3baa", "ja": "……っ……ノエル……！", "zh": "……呜……诺艾儿……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1068_038chz", "source_sha256": "342aff199d29043422f1e6079d2126595a115b1d7cda28b647ae0d7de7506e00", "ja": "……考えるな。私は剣だ。一振りの刃だ。\n命じられたままに敵を討つのみ。今までのように……。", "zh": "……不要想太多。我是剑，是一把利刃。\n只需奉命讨伐敌人。就像我一直以来做的一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1069_046rio", "source_sha256": "810d8c9cf0c72811ff7788bc3dc76d93dd6df0779eff320933956bd16781e624", "ja": "どうどう！？　{$P$}くん！\n私、かなりのセクシーっぷりじゃなかった！？", "zh": "如何如何！？{$P$}！\n我的样子有没有非常性感！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1070_p", "source_sha256": "f57a0e01759b3d99e086ae838782976c062c02c184df80aeac8400d18eb7a70f", "ja": "うん、いい悪女っぷりだったと思うよ。\nセクシーはともかく。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得你演得非常像真的坏女人。\n先不论性不性感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1071_046rio", "source_sha256": "63bc1c758df1313df66e65291b5e86e90e045635d9ad7e272c1b217aaa6fd6ca", "ja": "あ、あら？　うーん、レッスンウェアじゃ、\n私のセクシーさが表せないのかしら……。", "zh": "这、这样啊？\n嗯～是因为穿训练课程服没办法展现出我的性感吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1072_007ior", "source_sha256": "5050249ab6f9c626ead6e582f18cda4d4f511197c50ca65bd11db737e14d4672", "ja": "まだほとんど出番がないのに、この存在感！\nさすが伊織ちゃんって感じよね♪", "zh": "虽然目前几乎没有戏份，却很有存在感！\n真不愧是伊织对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_02_1073_007ior", "source_sha256": "93cf4129539db2e53529c5e145569fe673c7deecb3b0c9bc970178f1c7ca6081", "ja": "千鶴の演技も、悪くなかったわよ。\n貴族の演じ方がわかってるじゃない♪", "zh": "千鹤的演技也无可挑剔喔。\n你很了解怎样诠释贵族嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
